*[[1942]] - [[World War II|Second World War]]: [[Japanese Navy]] attacks [[Colombo]] in [[Ceylon]] ([[Sri Lanka]]). [[Royal Navy]] [[Cruisers]] [[HMS Cornwall]] and [[HMS Dorsetshire]] are sunk southwest of the island.
